  "final_message": "Done. Built the full sensor dashboard.\n\n**Backend** (`backend/app.py`): Flask + SQLite (WAL, `./data/sensors.db`), auth with hashed passwords and bearer tokens, all `/api` endpoints with owner-only writes, newest-first readings with `total`/`limit`, server-set `recorded_at`, and SPA/asset serving.\n\n**Frontend** (React/TS + Tailwind v4 + Recharts): auth forms with signed-in state/sign-out, live sensor cards with relative timestamps (10s refresh), sensor detail page with line chart + readings table, and owner forms for registering/posting/deleting (with confirmation).\n\nVerified: typecheck, `npm ci && npm run build`, 50+ API checks, gunicorn with 2 workers, and data persistence across restart.",
